# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — must never be committed
#
# Real secrets live in environment variables (server) and the OS credential
# store (desktop). .env.example is the only environment file in the repo and it
# contains variable NAMES with no usable values.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.envrc
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.der
*.jks
*.keystore
credentials/
secrets/
vault/
runtime/
sessions/
sentry.properties
.sentryclirc

# User data / local databases (never committed)
config/settings.json
config/settings.json.local
config/onboarding.json
config/sessions.json
config/users.json
web/config/*.json
web/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.vault

